<title>USA: Industrial Holdings to acquire company.</title>
<headline>Industrial Holdings to acquire company.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial Holdings Inc said on Thursday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire Rogers Equipment and Supply Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The privately held company sells and repairs blow out preventers that are used primarily in oil and gas drilling applications.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
